    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47497" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠπιόω</span></b> , intr., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feel easier</i>, 
